# Language

- **Always reply to Hugo in French**: explanations, plans, questions, end-of-task summaries and review comments, even when the previous turn or the files are in English.
- Code, identifiers, code comments, commit messages, ADRs and technical docs are written in **English**.
- Quote code, file names and commands as they are. Do not translate them.
- Visible game text is never hard-coded: it goes through i18n keys with French and English versions (ADR 0007).
